   <title>Kenya cult leader Paul Mackenzie sentenced to 200 years</title>
   <link>https://www.dw.com/en/kenya-cult-leader-paul-mackenzie-sentenced-to-200-years/a-79875112?maca=en-rss-en-africa-8291-xml-mrss</link>
